{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后佘詩曼（阿佘）在劇集《新聞女王》中飾演「Man姐」深入民心，人氣持續高企。</p><p>她在上海出席活動，以一身白色西裝套裝亮相，盡顯「Man姐」的氣場與知性美，吸引大批粉絲追星圍觀，她在現場大擺不同甫士，展露甜美親切的笑容，期間不停大派心心，又單眼</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.149056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758301+00:00","content_hash":"a6f9856a9c4c446677cd0ce5dd81b7030ed5f79b46cca6dbec2657200f96ce96","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}